    "title": "From pit-stops to go-to destinations: The transformation of service stations",
    "summary": "Motorway service stations, long seen as a quick stop for fuel and a sandwich, are being reimagined as places people choose to visit. Operators are investing in food, design and experiences that turn the pause on a journey into part of the trip.",
    "source": "BBC News",
    "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckqx5rylp9elo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss",
