    "Pit Stop, Promoted to Destination",
    "Neon in the Middle of Nowhere",
    "The Long Road's Quiet Pause"
  ],
  "sublines": [
    "Once a quick break on a long journey, service stations are becoming places people travel to on purpose.",
    "Fuel and a sandwich are giving way to better food, design and reasons to linger beside the motorway.",
    "The humble roadside stop is being rebuilt as a destination, and the journey now includes the break."
